## Scenarios

### utf16 byte conversion guards

#### keeps valid little-endian bytes

- Verify: keeps valid little-endian bytes


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 3 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
step("Verify: keeps valid little-endian bytes")
assert_equal(utf16_from_bytes_le([0x41, 0x00]), [0x41])
```

</details>

#### keeps valid big-endian bytes

- Verify: keeps valid big-endian bytes


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 3 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
step("Verify: keeps valid big-endian bytes")
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
assert_equal(utf16_from_bytes_be([0x00, 0x41]), [0x41])
```

</details>

#### rejects malformed little-endian bytes

- Verify: rejects malformed little-endian bytes


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 3 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
step("Verify: rejects malformed little-endian bytes")
assert_equal(utf16_from_bytes_le([-1, 0x00, 0x41, 300]), [0xFFFD, 0xFFFD])
```

</details>

#### rejects malformed big-endian bytes

- Verify: rejects malformed big-endian bytes


